    {
      "id": "d9d16f45-6887-ef11-8474-000d3a37e3b6",
      "type": "GeneralText",
      "area": "General",
      "position": 5,
      "content": "The core Communication program broadly prepares students for one of two required concentrations: Strategic Communication and Creative Communication. Strategic Communication is a more professionally oriented four-course sequence that includes intensive training and experience in public relations, advertising, and marketing. The Creative Communication Concentration takes a broader approach, allowing students to choose from four to nine courses in communication subject matter ranging from creative writing to video editing and from storytelling to communication technology. Several courses in the Creative Communication Concentration have prerequisites that might be completed at the Community College level. See further details by search the degree at Program Finder .",
      "contentHtml": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">The core Communication program broadly prepares students for one of two required concentrations: </span><strong style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Strategic Communication</strong><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"> and </span><strong style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Creative Communication. </strong></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Strategic Communication is a more professionally oriented four-course sequence that includes intensive training and experience in public relations, advertising, and marketing. The Creative Communication Concentration takes a broader approach, allowing students to choose from four to nine courses in communication subject matter ranging from creative writing to video editing and from storytelling to communication technology.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Several courses in the Creative Communication Concentration have prerequisites that might be completed at the Community College level. See further details by search the degree at </span><a href=\"https://www.nu.edu/program-finder/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Program Finder</a>.</p>"
    }
